<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82277" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστόμ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>round a mouth</i> or
				<i>aperture</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.603
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστόμιον</span></b> , τό, <i>mouth of a vessel</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίθου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					21.28.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mouth-band</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορβειᾷ καὶ περιστομίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.456b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>region of the epiglottis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>collar</i> of a garment, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				30.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>edge</i> of a ravine, ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ez.</u>
				39.11
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
